+# Markdown Previewer
+
+This is a simple markdown previewer.
+
+## How to Use
+1. Write your markdown content in the input area below.
+2. The rendered markdown will appear here in real-time.
+
+## Example
+```markdown
+**Bold Text**
+*Italic Text*
+- List Item 1
+- List Item 2
+```